  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 24.0,
      "text": "We were drifting and charged particles in a quiet field"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 34.0,
      "text": "No orbit, no language, just distance that felt like truth"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "How I was alone like drunk circling a thing, a question without a frame"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 52.0,
      "text": "You were a frequency I couldn't measure but somehow I felt your name"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "And the static of crowded rooms and the blur of passing light"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "There was something unfinished waiting to ignite"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 70.0,
      "text": "Fallen is open and just wide, we were incomplete by design"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "We don't fall, we rearrange, share the space, re-shaped the same"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.0,
      "end": 84.0,
      "text": "Not a fighting line apart, just invisible architecture"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.0,
      "end": 89.0,
      "text": "We are covalent hearts"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.0,
      "end": 106.0,
      "text": "No collision, no explosion, just a quiet overlap"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "You held part of my silence, I held part of your past"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.0,
      "end": 124.0,
      "text": "And the world kept spinning unaware of the bond forming in thin air"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.0,
      "end": 129.0,
      "text": "Not force, not fate, just balance, we both kept there"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.0,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "No excess, no lack, just enough to bring us back"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 142.0,
      "text": "We don't break, we combine, trace the dark"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.0,
      "end": 150.0,
      "text": "We define every fracture plays a part in this shared equation"
    },
    {
      "start": 150.0,
      "end": 157.0,
      "text": "We are covalent hearts"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.0,
      "end": 170.0,
      "text": "Not fusion, not fire, no burning collapse"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.0,
      "end": 175.0,
      "text": "Just a gentle agreement between what we lacked"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.0,
      "end": 182.0,
      "text": "If the universe gathered us into separate frames"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.0,
      "end": 189.0,
      "text": "We'd still find symmetry in different names"
    },
    {
      "start": 189.0,
      "end": 194.0,
      "text": "Bound by nothing held by choice"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.0,
      "end": 201.0,
      "text": "Every silence finds a fool"
    },
    {
      "start": 201.0,
      "end": 208.0,
      "text": "We don't end, we transform, shift the shape"
    },
    {
      "start": 209.0,
      "end": 213.0,
      "text": "Keep the form, every distance leaves a mark"
    },
    {
      "start": 213.0,
      "end": 222.0,
      "text": "That pulls us back together, we are covalent hearts"
    },
    {
      "start": 225.0,
      "end": 230.0,
      "text": "No edges, no just shared space"
    },
    {
      "start": 230.0,
      "end": 234.0,
      "text": "No, before no separate place"
    },
    {
      "start": 234.0,
      "end": 239.0,
      "text": "Only us, only us"
    },
    {
      "start": 241.0,
      "end": 244.0,
      "text": "And quiet orbit we adjust"
    }
  ],
